    "shipped is the policy config's OOD action (conservative); off makes the optimizer ignore the OOD verdict, an experiment switch (--ood off) the gateway never uses",
    "the OOD verdict and score are request-level and computed by the artifact, so they are the same in every arm; the off arm computes them and does not act on them",
    "the test split is replayed once, only for its OOD scores (the negatives of the AUROC)",
    "floor compliance counts only the decisions whose floor was not relaxed"
  ]
}
